1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:05,460
(Sheldon:)I came here to defeat Wil Wheaton,
the man who destroyed my dreams.

2
00:00:05,630 --> 00:00:11,010
(Sheldon:)But I can't defeat Wil Wheaton,
the man who loved his memaw.

3
00:00:14,764 --> 00:00:17,644
(Leonard:)-Enchanted Bunny.
-No!

4
00:00:17,809 --> 00:00:20,689
(Raj:)Not Enchanted Bunny!

5
00:00:22,272 --> 00:00:24,152
I call my memaw "nana."

6
00:00:25,525 --> 00:00:27,405
And she's gonna be very happy
to hear...

7
00:00:27,569 --> 00:00:30,739
(Wil Wheaton:)...that my Small Rock
kills your Enchanted Bunny.

8
00:00:31,990 --> 00:00:35,490
(Wil Wheaton:)Game over, Moon Pie.

9
00:00:38,872 --> 00:00:42,502
(Bernadette:)I don't understand.
Your grandmother's alive?

10
00:00:42,667 --> 00:00:44,297
(Wil Wheaton:)Oh, you catch on quick.

11
00:00:44,878 --> 00:00:48,168
(Wil Wheaton:)Come on, Stewie,
let's get our prize money.

12
